PART B -- the gate:  R_k = 1 for all k  <=>  K = 1  (H = c L^g)
==========================================================================
  random binary forms tested    : 383
  (R == all ones)  ==  (K == 1) : 383/383   violations: 0
  K histogram                   : {1: 6, 2: 68, 3: 84, 4: 87, 5: 92, 6: 39, 7: 7}
  PROOF (exact, all fields, A_k != 0): R_k=1 for all k <=> h_k geometric
        <=> A_k = binom(g,k) r^k <=> H = A_0 (x + r y)^g <=> K=1.
  COROLLARY (with PART A): an automorphism of C^2 of degree > 1 has
        R(H) == 1 identically, i.e. leading-form circuit c(H) == 0.
        Contrapositive: c(H) != 0  ==>  (P,Q) is NOT an automorphism.

